---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="dark">
  <head>
    <BaseHead 
      title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE_TITLE}`} 
      description="Privacy policy and data telemetry disclosures for AetherArcade, including Google AdSense cookies and local storage." 
    />
  </head>
  <body class="static-page-body">
    <Header />

    <main class="static-page-main">
      <div class="content-container">
        <span class="pill-label">LEGAL & PRIVACY</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated-date"><em>Last Updated: September 2026</em></p>

        <p>
          At <strong>AetherArcade</strong>, accessible from our website, the privacy of our visitors is of paramount importance to us. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by AetherArcade and how we use it.
        </p>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <h2>1. Client-Side Architecture & Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
          AetherArcade operates on a 100% client-side gaming model. We do not require accounts, logins, or server-side database profiles.
        </p>
        <p>
          We utilize standard HTML5 <strong>localStorage</strong> directly within your browser solely for:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Saving your local settings and game configurations (e.g., custom participants, roulette items).</li>
          <li>Preserving your sound mute preferences (<code>aether_sound_muted</code>).</li>
          <li>Saving your visual theme choice (dark mode vs. light mode).</li>
        </ul>
        <p>This data never leaves your device and can be cleared at any time by clearing your browser cache.</p>

        <h2>2. Third-Party Advertising & Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          AetherArcade currently operates completely ad-free. We do not run display banners, video interstitials, or sponsored tracking scripts. Should third-party advertising partners (such as Google AdSense) be introduced in future updates to support server infrastructure, standard cookie opt-out disclosures (including <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a> and <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AboutAds.info</a>) will apply.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Log Files</h2>
        <p>
          Like almost all modern websites, AetherArcade uses standard server log files. These files merely log visitors to the site—usually a standard procedure for hosting services and analytics. The information collected by log files includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamps, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks. These are not linked to any information that is personally identifiable.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
          Another part of our priority is adding protection for children while using the internet. We encourage parents and guardians to observe, participate in, and/or monitor and guide their online activity. AetherArcade does not knowingly collect any Personal Identifiable Information from children under the age of 13.
        </p>

        <h2>5. CCPA Privacy Rights (Do Not Sell My Personal Information)</h2>
        <p>
          Under the CCPA, California consumers have the right to request that a business disclose what personal data it collects, delete any collected personal data, and not sell the consumer's personal data. We do not sell any personal information.
        </p>

        <h2>6. GDPR Data Protection Rights</h2>
        <p>
          We want to ensure you are fully aware of all of your data protection rights. Every user is entitled to the right of access, rectification, erasure, restrict processing, and data portability.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us at <code>privacy@aetherarcade.com</code> or via our <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .static-page-body {
    background: #090d16 !important;
    color: #f1f5f9 !important;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .static-page-main {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .content-container {
    background: #0f172a;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .pill-label {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #a855f7;
    background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.25);
    padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #f8fafc;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .updated-date {
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f8fafc;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }

  p {
    color: #94a3b8;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  ul {
    color: #cbd5e1;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  a {
    color: #38bdf8;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  code {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .content-container {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>